<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Country Rd sees small pickup in sales.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Country Rd sees small pickup in sales.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian fashion house Country Road Ltd said on Tuesday it had noticed a &quot;glimmer of improvement&quot; in sales over the past few weeks and expected a pick-up in trading conditions over the next six months.</p>
</text>
